# Received / logged data and downloaded models, in ANY folder: the apps'
# default folders are ignored per app (kraken_doa_v2/.gitignore); these catch
# the same data in a folder the user picked (Decoder Logging's folder,
# KRAKEN_WHISPER_MODELS) or written by the offline tools (sigtool.py captures,
# a plugin's `decoder --file ... --audio`, digi_test --voice). A test vector
# that really belongs in the repo needs `git add -f`
# Decoder Logging days + Voice to Text audio clips
decoders-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].jsonl
